{"at": "2026-11-05T15:04:48.493+00:00", "target": "deepseek", "status": 200, "elapsed_s": 1.13, "model": "deepseek-chat", "messages": 2, "tools_offered": 22, "tool_calls": [], "content": "我这边是修图助手，只能处理图片相关的需求，查不了天气。如果你有图片要修，随时告诉我。", "finish_reason": "stop", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 4833, "completion_tokens": 26, "total_tokens": 4859, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 4608}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 4608, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 225}}
{"at": "2026-11-05T15:04:50.851+00:00", "target": "deepseek", "status": 200, "elapsed_s": 1.744, "model": "deepseek-chat", "messages": 2, "tools_offered": 22, "tool_calls": [], "content": "这个功能目前做不到——我只能对图片做修图处理（去背景、换背景、调色、拆层、改尺寸、生成营销图等），无法把平面图转成可旋转查看的 3D 模型。\n\n如果你需要，我可以帮你做这些替代方案：\n- 生成多角度的商品图（正面、侧面、背面等），方便你后续做 360° 展示素材\n- 出一张场景氛围图或白底主图\n- 把主体抠出来，方便你放到 3D 展示工具里\n\n你想选哪个？", "finish_reason": "stop", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 4841, "completion_tokens": 121, "total_tokens": 4962, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 4608}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 4608, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 233}}
